Rest\">Long Rest</a> due to the wily resourcefulness now bubbling within it.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Given by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/38px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/50px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Araj Oblodra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\">Araj Oblodra</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> and later in <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> in exchange for human blood\n</p>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Araj's elixirs function independently of other elixirs, stacking with them and each other.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202324\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.076 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2218/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38425/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8675/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstr